<title>FRANCE: Havas seen making CEP bid today.</title>
<headline>Havas seen making CEP bid today.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media group Havas is expected to announce its bid for the minorities in its CEP Communication unit later today which could cost between 2.5 and 3.0 billion francs, the Les Echos and La Tribune newspapers said.</p>
<p>The statement is expected after Bourse closing on Thursday.</p>
<p>CEP was suspended on Tuesday at 400 francs, pending a statement, and the market immediately speculated that 74-percent owner Havas would make a bid. Havas did not comment on the rumours.</p>
</text>
